1
00:00:01,390 --> 00:00:03,788
As Uke comes to strike the side of your head

2
00:00:03,789 --> 00:00:04,712
step in deeply

3
00:00:04,713 --> 00:00:07,371
and lead the strike around in a big circular movement,

4
00:00:07,672 --> 00:00:10,505
controlling his wrist 
position the body to his rear,

5
00:00:10,506 --> 00:00:12,212
turn again and cut down

6
00:00:12,613 --> 00:00:14,169
As Uke comes round

7
00:00:14,170 --> 00:00:18,405
controlling his wrist 
turn his wrist and cut down 
directly in front of your center

8
00:00:18,806 --> 00:00:21,852
Controlling his elbow turn Uke´s body over

9
00:00:21,853 --> 00:00:24,231
controlling his wrist tightly against the body

10
00:00:24,732 --> 00:00:27,051
as you do so turn for the pin.

